        {
          "id": 2482665007,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It's better to set them in `recent_read_profile_static` so that the values get reset to default if user switches profiles to a profile whose recent file doesn't yet have the entries. `recent_init` is only called once, at startup.",
